    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=-5\\pm2\\sqrt5$.\n\nComplete the square to obtain $(x+5)^2=20$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+5)^2-20&=0\\\\(x+5)^2&=20\\\\x+5&=\\pm\\sqrt{20}\\\\x&=-5\\pm2\\sqrt5\\end{align*}$$",
